# Stocky needs no environment variables.
#
# The frontend talks to PocketBase on its own origin (new PocketBase('/')), and
# in dev Vite proxies /api and /_/ to a local PocketBase on 127.0.0.1:8090
# (vite.config.js). Runtime settings such as SMTP live in PocketBase's own
# settings inside pb_data/, set in the dashboard, never in a file here.
#
# Firebase was dropped (spec decision #14): don't add VITE_FIREBASE_* or any
# other credentials. Anything VITE_* ends up in the public bundle.
